01:12:16.735 --> 01:12:17.375
But

01:12:19.535 --> 01:12:21.935
I think we're up and running, moving

01:12:22.575 --> 01:12:23.855
forward on that.

01:12:24.895 --> 01:12:26.015
At the last,

01:12:27.215 --> 01:12:30.175
Alma, Andover Lake Management Association,

01:12:30.255 --> 01:12:30.975
and Alcoa,

